Provider catalogue
------------------

The searchable list of Anthropic-compatible endpoints in Settings is adapted
from cc-switch (https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch), which is MIT
licensed. Only the endpoint data was taken: names, base URLs, authentication
header and API format.

Inclusion is not a recommendation. Colonizer does not vet, endorse or have any
relationship with the services listed, several of which resell access to models
they do not run. Some carried commercial-partner flags in the source catalogue;
those flags were not imported, and no placement here was paid for.

